# Contributing

Contributions to ArchaeoSightDesktop are welcome.

Anyone is free to contribute to the project by:

* **Opening an issue** to report bugs, suggest improvements, or propose new features.
* **Submitting a pull request** with changes, improvements, or new functionality.

When submitting an issue or pull request, please **provide a clear justification for the proposed change**. Explain what problem it addresses, why the change would be beneficial, and, when applicable, how it improves the project.

All contributions will be reviewed before being incorporated into the project. Contributions may be accepted, modified, or declined based on their relevance, technical merit, and compatibility with the goals of the project.

Thank you for helping improve ArchaeoSightDesktop!
